	<div class="page-content builder-container" x-data="easystoreProductDetails">

				<section id="section-id-1649265402895" class="sppb-section" ><div class="sppb-row-container"><div class="sppb-row"><div class="sppb-col-md-12  " id="column-wrap-id-1649265402894"><div id="column-id-1649265402894" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1649265402901" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-text-block"><div id="sppb-addon-1649265402901" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-text-block " ><h3 class="sppb-addon-title">Report Suspected Unauthorized or Unlicensed VA/VASP Activity</h3><div class="sppb-addon-content  "><p>Should you have reasonable suspicion or belief that you have engaged or partook in the services of an entity which is claiming to be licensed or registered by or in the Seychelles please complete the below form.</p>
<p>By completing and submitting this form, you will be assisting the Financial Services Authority in ensuring that any unlicensed or unauthorised activities are effectively addressed.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1649265921863" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-module"><div id="sppb-addon-1649265921863" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-module "><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div id="cf_12" class="convertforms cf cf-img-above cf-form-bottom cf-success-hideform  cf-hasLabels   cf-labelpos-top" data-id="12">
